WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.051 --> 00:00:03.945
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.946 --> 00:00:06.250
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.251 --> 00:00:16.779
They see kids in costumes.

4
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:39.335
The blobs want to trick-or-treat too.

5
00:00:39.336 --> 00:00:50.932
A clown gives them treats.

6
00:00:50.933 --> 00:01:10.630
A police officer gives them treats.

7
00:01:10.631 --> 00:01:30.753
A superhero gives them treats.

8
00:01:30.754 --> 00:01:47.378
A wizard gives them treats.

9
00:01:47.379 --> 00:02:03.350
An alien gives them treats.

10
00:02:03.351 --> 00:02:10.184
Oh, the skeleton has treats.

11
00:02:10.185 --> 00:02:12.866
It plays a trick too!

12
00:02:12.867 --> 00:02:19.338
Wow! That's a spooky surprise.

13
00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.985
Silly blobs.

14
00:02:21.986 --> 00:02:25.468
Good-bye!

